# Phase 5 Walkthrough: Financial Tools & Early Withdrawals

I have successfully executed the implementation for the "My Contributions" dashboard and the Interactive Financial Calculators!

## 💰 1. My Contributions Dashboard (React)
I have built the fully consolidated dashboard that provides users with a comprehensive snapshot of their social insurance financials.
- **Aggregated View**: Displays Total Lifetime Savings, Estimated Monthly Pension, and Active Pay.
- **Early Withdrawal Logic**: The UI automatically partitions the "Total Savings" into **30% Personal Loan Credit** and **70% Emergency Fund Relief**. It also displays the 3-year vesting period lock status.
- **Contribution History**: A detailed data table showing historical contributions across previous employers and payment statuses.

